==Battleground==
*1 [[Package Doge]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Remember, Package Doge is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy and only deals 1 damage. Use fast attackers like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] to finish the stage quickly and easily.

